  "description": {
   "en": "Akiko is a 33-year-old single woman who moved from the countryside to Tokyo and became the manager of a general store called \"Wahldo.\" One day, she finds a cardboard box with the words \"please pick me up\" written on it. When she opens it, an old lady with a funky look pops out! Her name is Atsuko, and she said she came to Tokyo looking for someone. The two women begin a life together full of warmth and chaos!"
  },
